        "⏳ Pending: 3D terrain + extruded buildings (OpenFreeMap)",
        "⏳ Pending: Dashboard modal overlay + 5 tabs + Recharts",
        "⏳ Pending: SSE streaming in chat + generation actions",
        "⏳ Pending: App.tsx wiring — Dashboard button opens overlay"
      ]
    }
